Constraints and their real-life concepts 

.primary key - national ID/ SSN
    .unique identifier 
    .must be unique, and NOT NULL
        i.e you must have one, and cannot be shared 


.foreign key - apartment lease agreement requires a valid building 
    .ensures records reference something that actually exists 
    .prevents ghost data 

.unique - only one person can have a specific apartment number  
    .prevents duplicates that break logic

.NOT NULL - mandatory information on a form
    .the required field must have a value


.check - rules you must follow 
    .enforces rules on the dataset 


.default - if you dont choose, we choose for you 
    .sets an automatic value when none is provided 


.auto-increment - the queue number at DMV 
    .automatically generates the next ID


.index - a library catalog system 
    .speed up searches 


.cascade - if the building is demolished, all leases end
    .automatically updates or deletes related records 
    